---
import Layout from '@portfolio/site/layouts/Layout.astro';
import ToolList from '../../components/ToolList.astro';
---
<Layout title="Free browser tools" description="Free tools by Charlie (chermdev) that run in your browser: Stripe fee, auto loan, mortgage, and compound interest calculators. Image and video compressors are next." image="tools"><section class="page-shell section"><p class="meta mb-5">Tools</p><h1 class="section-heading">Free tools that run in your browser.</h1><div class="mt-6 mb-14 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-6"><p class="lead">No sign-up, and your inputs stay on your device. Each tool shows its assumptions and the math behind it.</p></div><ToolList /><div class="mt-12 rounded-2xl bg-secondary p-7"><h2 class="text-lg font-medium">Numbers you can look inside.</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-muted-foreground">Every calculator shows its assumptions. Change the rates, explore a different scenario, and see how the result changes. Estimates are a starting point, not a lender quote or a Stripe invoice.</p></div></section></Layout>
